{"about_the_game":"<strong>Dungeon 100</strong> is a roguelite that combines the deep theory-crafting and player choice of classic ARPGs like Diablo and Path of Exile with autobattler gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>ARPG Experience Without the Grind</strong> - No equipment and gear to spend countless hours grinding for. Instead freely choose from hundreds of cards to combine them in interesting ways for diverse character build possibilities.<br></li><li> <strong>Unlimited Character Customization</strong> - Create unique skills by combining different effects of the hundreds of available cards. Transform into a bear that spits out dozens of flaming arrows a second, or summon hounds that can summon even more hounds, or play as a spin-to-win warrior! <br></li><li> <strong>Become the Dungeon Boss</strong> - Every 15 floors of the dungeon, there will be a dragon. Slay the dragon and you will become the Boss of that floor. You must then defeat your past characters to progress further into the dungeon.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Transformation at Level 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1711610/f3249c90af1a5878c181f9a7aefe0e98640582b8.jpg"},{"name":"Transformation at Level 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1711610/f3249c90af1a5878c181f9a7aefe0e98640582b8.jpg"},{"name":"Transformation at Level 45","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1711610/f3249c90af1a5878c181f9a7aefe0e98640582b8.jpg"},{"name":"Transformation at Level 60","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1711610/f3249c90af1a5878c181f9a7aefe0e98640582b8.jpg"},{"name":"Transformation at Level 75","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1711610/f3249c90af1a5878c181f9a7aefe0e98640582b8.jpg"},{"name":"Transformation at Level 90","path":"https://c